<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Order Confirmed | ART STUDIO</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f5f2ee;
            color: #171717;
        }
        .wrap {
            max-width: 760px;
            margin: 80px auto;
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #ebdfd5;
            padding: 40px 28px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 38px;
            margin-top: 0;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #444;
        }
        .box {
            background: #f9f6f2;
            border: 1px solid #f0e4d8;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 22px;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #111;
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="wrap">
        <h1>Order Confirmed</h1>
        <p>Thank you, <%= order.name %>. Your artwork request has been received and will be prepared for delivery.</p>

        <div class="box">
            <strong>Order summary</strong>
            <p>
                Reference: <%= order.reference %><br>
                Payment method: <%= order.payment_method.toUpperCase() %><br>
                Total: $<%= formatCurrency(order.total) %><br>
                Email: <%= order.email %>
            </p>
        </div>

        <p>We will send confirmation and shipping details to your inbox shortly.</p>
        <a href="/" class="btn">Continue shopping</a>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
